OL,3,ADisability benefit review calls for
OL,4,Acloser link with claimant costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main disability benefit in England
OL,7,Fand Wales should be more closely linked
OL,8,Fto the additional costs claimants face,
OL,9,Fa government-commissioned review has
OL,10,Frecommended.
OL,12,FThe review on personal independence
OL,13,Fpayment (Pip) led by Disability
OL,14,FMinister Sir Stephen Timms said the
OL,15,Fcurrent system was "not appropriate"
OL,16,Ffor claimants who do not have any extra
OL,17,Fcosts arising from their condition.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
